ContractWrapper.proto imports ~60 other upstream files that are not copied.
No code is generated from these files. joseph_execution.adapters.venues.
mexc_protobuf transcribes the fields it needs into protobuf descriptors,
and tests/unit/venues/test_mexc_protobuf.py checks that transcription
against these files. To update: copy the new upstream files here, record
the commit and hashes above, and run that test.
